The fact-check refutes the claim by establishing that Dustin Diamond died on **February 1, 2021**, from **stage 4 small cell carcinoma (lung cancer)**, as consistently reported by sources like [IMDb](https://www.imdb.com/name/nm0224616/trivia/) and [USA Today](https://bigbrother.fandom.com/wiki/Dustin_Diamond). He was not incarcerated at the time of his death, having previously served a brief jail sentence in 2015, and there is **no evidence from official records or reputable reports** of a prison riot or injuries contributing to his death. [Snopes](https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/dustin-diamond-murder/) explicitly labels the claim a "hoax," and the provided date of October 2020 is incorrect.